while more people are shopping online of  course so that means more deliveries  law enforcement officers want you to  watch out for porch pirates  bianca holman shows us how you can  protect your holiday gifts from thieves  how the grinch stole christmas might be  your favorite holiday movie but it can  become a reality for some  that's because thieves are looking to  steal packages right from your doorstep  what people need to do is target harden  their own  residence or their own place of business  and you know advise your neighbor if  you're not going to be around or you  expect to receive a package or if you  have a security guard through an hoa  advise them and help maybe they can help  you some criminals are so bold  they follow delivery trucks quietly  waiting nearby for the chance to steal  packages  you have the option to inform the  delivery driver where to leave your  boxes  maybe over a fence or behind a large  plant  one major step you can take to protect  your packages is having a doorbell  camera or some type of security system  you can register your camera with metro  have their video cameras working  that's a definite assist for the police  department do an investigation  and it's important for people to be  aware of their surroundings so  don't make it easy for the crooks the  sheriff also says don't post on social  media  sharing the fact that you'll be out of  town that could make you a target  reporting bianca holman 8 news now
 

